  "description": "Azure OpenAI and Azure AI Foundry integration for TokenRateGate. Eliminates HTTP 429 rate limit errors with intelligent TPM/RPM management, managed identity support, and multi-deployment capabilities.",
  "id": "TokenRateGate.Azure",
  "isPrerelease": false,
